                "description": "Update an existing task's fields.\n### Three-state logic\n1. **Field omitted**: `description` is ignored and the existing database value remains unchanged.\n2. **Field provided**: `\"description\": \"My homework\"` - sets a new description in the database.\n3. **Field provided with NULL**: `\"description\": null` - clears the description in the database.\nConstraints: `title` and `completed` cannot be set to null.",
